  "body": "Welcome to 29 Mahinga Kai Road, a stunning single-level sanctuary situated in Orewa's highly sought-after new Stratmill development. \r\n\r\nWhether you are a first home buyer eager to step onto the property ladder, a downsizer looking for a low-maintenance lock-and-leave or a savvy investor seeking a high-appeal rental, this home delivers on every front.\r\n\r\nDesigned with modern coastal living in mind, the heart of the home is anchored by a sun-drenched, north-facing lounge that radiates warmth throughout the day. The seamless open-plan kitchen and dining area make entertaining a breeze, while custom built-in cabinetry-including an elegant TV unit and display cabinet-adds a touch of bespoke luxury. A premium central air conditioning system ensures perfect, effortless climate control all year round.\r\n\r\nAccommodation is well catered for with three generously sized bedrooms, providing plenty of space for family or guests. The master suite serves as a private retreat, complete with its own beautifully appointed ensuite, while a sleek second family bathroom and an internal-access single garage complete this highly functional floor plan.\r\n\r\nThe location is truly unbeatable. Families will appreciate being securely in zone for the highly regarded Orewa College, while weekend lovers are just minutes away from the golden sands and vibrant cafes of beautiful Orewa Beach. With incredibly easy motorway access, you get to enjoy the absolute best of relaxed coastal living without sacrificing commuting convenience.\r\n\r\nOpportunities in the new Stratmill development are highly coveted. Don't miss your chance to secure this beautiful home-contact us today to arrange your private viewing or visit our next open home!\r\n\r\nProperty Features at a Glance:\r\n\r\nAddress: 29 Mahinga Kai Road, Orewa (New Stratmill Development)\r\n\r\nLayout: 3 Generous Bedrooms | 2 Bathrooms (including Master Ensuite)\r\n\r\nLiving: Open-plan kitchen & dining with a sunny north-facing lounge\r\n\r\nComfort: Central air conditioning & bespoke built-in TV/display cabinetry\r\n\r\nConvenience: Single-level living with a secure single garage\r\n\r\nLocation: Minutes to Orewa Beach & motorway access\r\n\r\nSchool Zoning: In zone for Orewa College\r\n\r\nContact us today to arrange a private viewing or see you at our open homes.",
